A Humble Request for a Job Opportunity

I am sharing the CV of a woman my mother happened to meet recently. Although she is not a close family acquaintance, her story deeply moved us, and I felt that sharing her profile might help connect her with the right opportunity.

She is a single woman who tragically lost her 26-year-old son in an accident. Today, she finds herself having to navigate life largely on her own, without the support she once had. Despite experiencing such an unimaginable loss, she has shown immense courage and is determined to rebuild her life, become financially independent, and earn a living through her own efforts.

Her circumstances touched me deeply, and rather than seeing her struggle without support, I wanted to make a small effort to help her reach people who may be able to give her a chance.

I sincerely request recruiters, HR professionals, business owners, and members of my LinkedIn network to kindly go through her CV and consider her for any suitable job opportunities matching her skills and experience.

She is not seeking sympathy — she is seeking an opportunity to work, earn with dignity, and stand on her own feet.

If you know of any suitable opening or can connect her with someone who may be able to help, please reach out to me directly. Even one genuine opportunity could make a meaningful difference in her life.

I would be truly grateful if you could share this post within your network so that it reaches the right person. 🙏

